This suite is declared in phpunit.xml and has no tests yet — Wave 0 has no HTTP surface to exercise.

This file exists because git does not track empty directories, and PHPUnit exits 2 with
"Test directory not found" when a declared suite's directory is absent. Without it the whole
suite is unrunnable from a fresh clone while passing in a working tree that still has the
untracked directory. Delete this file when the first test lands here.
